{"id":"n69533-1-13","stage":1,"title":"이해 · 理解","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69533-1-13-1","ko":"이 개념이 무엇인지 이해를 했니?","zh":"你明白这个概念是什么了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"개념이","meaning":"概念，观念","explanation":"개념：概念，观念；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"개념","audio":"/audio/08e0dfd4fcdc514da446.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23768","senseId":"1","lemma":"개념","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무엇인지","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"무엇","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17199","senseId":"1","lemma":"무엇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이해를","meaning":"理解","explanation":"이해：理解；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"이해","audio":"/audio/da2995a8c183c1cabd41.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69533","senseId":"3","lemma":"이해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했니?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"08e0dfd4fcdc514d","term":"개념","zh":"概念，观念","audio":"/audio/08e0dfd4fcdc514da446.mp3","entryId":"23768","definition":"通过关于某个事实、观念或事物的多种具体范例或特性而获得的一般知识或想法。","pronunciation":["개ː념"]},{"id":"c95167f3fe21887b","term":"무엇","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3","entryId":"17199","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["무얻"]},{"id":"da2995a8c183c1ca","term":"이해","zh":"理解","audio":"/audio/da2995a8c183c1cabd41.mp3","entryId":"69533","definition":"知道某物是什么；或指接受某物是什么。","pronunciation":["이ː해"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4b450fa3207c1d187b6e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69533-1-13-2","ko":"잘 이해가 안 되는데, 한 번만 더 알려 주세요.","zh":"我还是不太懂，能再讲一遍吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이해가","meaning":"理解","explanation":"이해：理解；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이해","audio":"/audio/da2995a8c183c1cabd41.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69533","senseId":"3","lemma":"이해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되는데,","meaning":"变得，弄得","explanation":"되다：变得，弄得；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"번만","meaning":"次，遍","explanation":"번：次，遍；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"2","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"再，多","explanation":"더：再，多","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"1","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알려","meaning":"告知","explanation":"알리다：告知；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"알리다","audio":"/audio/c8eae4fd8a7a21d57d22.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29770","senseId":"1","lemma":"알리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"da2995a8c183c1ca","term":"이해","zh":"理解","audio":"/audio/da2995a8c183c1cabd41.mp3","entryId":"69533","definition":"知道某物是什么；或指接受某物是什么。","pronunciation":["이ː해"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得，弄得","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"达到某种情况或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一个的。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"dfccc17e2997aa8d","term":"번","zh":"次，遍","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3","entryId":"26846","definition":"计算事情次数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["번"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"再，多","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"添补而继续。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"c8eae4fd8a7a21d5","term":"알리다","zh":"告知","audio":"/audio/c8eae4fd8a7a21d57d22.mp3","entryId":"29770","definition":"使醒悟或得知原本不知道或忘记的事情。","pronunciation":["알리다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/195ef7e704468a439bf4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.872,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69533","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":56,"sequenceScore":2.4696,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我还是不太懂，能再讲一遍吗？","你明白这个概念是什么了吗？","亲爱的，我头痛得厉害。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你明白这个概念是什么了吗？","亲爱的，我头痛得厉害。","我还是不太懂，能再讲一遍吗？"],"answer":2}]}
